## MVP: What We Promised the Client

A tool similar to a **Gemini Gem or Claude Project** where HR can:

1. Paste a stale position description
2. Get a classification recommendation (up to 2 career group/role matches)
3. Get a compensation range recommendation (W&M salary grade, e.g., S15)
4. Read the reasoning why

This works **today** with our reference data + prompt template in any LLM. No ML model required.

**Everything below the MVP is academic scope added for course credit.** If timeline forces cuts, we cut from the bottom up, never from the MVP.

