## How to Test Classification (MVP)

1. Open a fresh LLM session (Claude, Copilot, Gemini -- any will work)
2. Paste the prompt from `classification_prompt_template_v1.md`
3. Attach the reference Excel files from `hr_handoff/`
4. Paste a W&M position description
5. The LLM should return: career group, role, pay band, and explanation

**Validated example:** Assistant Controller -> Financial Services Manager III (19036) -> Band 7 -> W&M S18
